  #line-at(70.824pt, 298.61pt, "Perovskite-silicon tandem technology has exceeded the single junction theoretical efficiency limit. ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 323.93pt, "However, there is still distance to the thermodynamic limit mainly caused by the fill factor. This work ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 349.25pt, "presents a methodology to illustrate the mechanisms of ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(311.81pt, 349.25pt, "FF")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(325.27pt, 349.25pt, " loss in perovskite-Si monolithic tandem solar ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 374.57pt, "cells. Apart from the series resistance related loss characterized by electroluminescence, another loss ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 399.89pt, "factor is from the photoshunt, a phenomenon in which the parallel resistance apparently reduces under ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 425.11pt, "illumination in perovskite solar cells due to the moderate charge transport layer mobility. In addoition, ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 450.43pt, "the two-diode property of the Si cell can also influence the ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(334.51pt, 450.43pt, "FF")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(347.95pt, 450.43pt, " of tandem devices. The photoshunt can ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 475.75pt, "be hidden when the bottom cell is over illuminated, which explains highly efficient tandem solar cells ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 501.07pt, "are usually bottom cell limited. This work outlines strategies that overcoming the photoshunt issue can ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 526.39pt, "move the perovskite top cell closer to low ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(257.93pt, 526.39pt, "FF")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(271.37pt, 526.39pt, " losses in tandem solar cells. ")
]

