  #line-at(92.424pt, 212.06pt, "The EQE measurements of perovskite-Si tandem solar cells were conducted by a setup with a xenon ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 231.02pt, "light source (Osram XPO 150 W) and a Bentham monochromator (TMC 300). The spectral range of the ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 250.01pt, "EQE setup is from 300 nm to 1100 nm. The simulated light source system was calibrated by using a ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 268.97pt, "photodiode (Gigahertz Optik SSO-PD 100-04). The tandem solar cells were installed in an electrically ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 287.93pt, "contacted measurement box for EQE characterization. The chopper frequency was 72 Hz. The ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 307.01pt, "wavelength step size was 10 nm for the whole measurement. To measure the EQE of perovskite top cell, ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 325.97pt, "the Si bottom cell was kept saturated. A bias voltage of 0.7 V was applied to maintain the tandem solar ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 344.93pt, "cell at short circuit condition. The EQE of Si bottom cell was measured in a condition that perovskite ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 363.89pt, "top cell was saturated by blue light from a LED light source. A bias voltage of 1.2 V was applied on the ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 382.85pt, "tandem solar cell to maintain the short circuit condition.  ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 425.83pt, "Electroluminescence characterization ")
